@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json
@accessToken = <paste_access_token_here>
@orderId = 1


### 1. Calculate total (before placing order)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/calculate
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "items": [
    { "menu_item_id": 1, "name": "Margherita", "quantity": 2, "price": 2500 },
    { "menu_item_id": 2, "name": "Cola",       "quantity": 1, "price": 500  }
  ]
}


### 2. Create order  →  скопируй id в @orderId выше
# @name createOrder
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "restaurant_id": 1,
  "items": [
    { "menu_item_id": 1, "name": "Margherita", "quantity": 2, "price": 2500 },
    { "menu_item_id": 2, "name": "Cola",       "quantity": 1, "price": 500  }
  ]
}


### 3. Get order
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 4. List my orders
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 5. Get order history
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/history
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}


### 6. Update order status  [AUTH]
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/status
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "status": "preparing"
}


### 7. Process payment
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/payment
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "method": "card",
  "amount": 5500
}


### 8. Cancel order
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/orders/{{orderId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}